\f1\b E3. Same-branch comparisons must be exact.
\f0\b0 \uc0\u8232 If two positions are on the same branch, branch-local ordering must not consult unrelated graph structure.\

\f1\b E4. Cache reuse must not change semantics.
\f0\b0 \uc0\u8232 Reusing a valid cache for repeated comparisons against the same reference must yield exactly the same answers as rebuilding it fresh.\

\f1\b E5. Ordering must not rely on trunk map behavior.
\f0\b0 \uc0\u8232 Forward branch installation and successor enumeration are separate concerns. Phase 3 ordering must be semantically correct even if successor navigation is incomplete.\
